00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:01,000
Like the guy who just died?

313
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Well, it won't be that easy to kill me.

314
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
No.

315
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,000
He was killed by someone else.

316
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:11,000
By a radical type of player who hunts his opposition.

317
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:16,000
The man who died was killed by someone called the Bomber.

318
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Bomber.

319
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:23,000
In this game, there are only three ways that a player can acquire item cards they can use.

320
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Know what they are?

321
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,000
Hmm.

322
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,000
Find them yourself.

323
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:30,000
You can also trade for them with other players.

324
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Or simply steal them from other players.

325
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,000
Yes.

326
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,000
Those are the three possible ways.

327
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:41,000
However, the number of players stealing from others has increased.

328
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:46,000
That's because of the card's acquisition difficulty and conversion limit.

329
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Players who can't obtain cards themselves often choose to take them from others.

330
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:57,000
If those players resist, they're killed by it.

331
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:00,000
Their ring disappears and the cards are lost.

332
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:04,000
But it increases the conversion limit for that type of card.

333
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,000
If you kill a player, you can't take his cards.

334
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,000
That rule was put in place to prevent players from killing each other.

335
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:17,000
But lately, it's been backfiring.

336
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:21,000
It's been over ten years since this game was first released.

337
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:25,000
If no one can find a way to beat it, the killing will only continue.

338
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
That's why all of us are all trying to end this mess.

339
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:30,000
We need more allies to clear the game.

340
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
That's where you come in.

341
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,000
