351
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,000
No.

352
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,000
We refuse to use violence to achieve our goal.

353
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Spells.

354
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
