359
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:15,000
We're going to use the very same card conversion limit.

360
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,000
That's been frustrating us.

361
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:19,000
It's the only way to clear the game.

